menu "Board"

config HOMECORE_BOARD_CLOCK_SETUP
    bool "Configure the system clock at startup"
    default y
    help
        Let the board configure its clock tree (oscillators, PLL, bus
        prescalers) during board_init(). Disable only for emulators that do
        not model the clock controller, such as QEMU's STM32 machines; the
        board then assumes the emulator's fixed CPU clock. Boards without
        clock setup ignore this option.

endmenu
